<title>USA: National Record Mart Oct sales, margins rise.</title>
<headline>National Record Mart Oct sales, margins rise.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Record Mart Inc said Tuesday that comparable store sales increased 6.1 percent in October.</p>
<p>The company also said that its store operating margins for the four week ending October 26, 1996, increased to 37.39 percent from 36.55 percent in the same period last year.</p>
</text>
